<title>ITALY: Italy's Bulgari to propose stock split.</title>
<headline>Italy's Bulgari to propose stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Bulgari said it is to propose a stock split to shareholders but did not give terms.</p>
<p>Bulgari said in a statement, &quot;Such a proposal has the aim of facilitating the purchase of Bulgari shares, above all by small and new shareholders, and to increase, in addition, the number of shares traded daily.&quot;</p>
</text>
